            "conditions": "覆盖 deep/shallow water、village、flat、forest 的路径与驻防，区分主动进攻和被攻击，记录移动可达性、受击类型和 steadfast 是否满足防守条件。",
            "sources": [us("Merman Warrior"), us("Merman Triton"), us("Merman Hoplite"), macro_src.get("ABILITY_STEADFAST", "未解析")],
